ine=false&lt;br&gt;Project ID binding / no build stages" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#759C6C;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="900.00" y="470.00" width="650.00" height="125.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n48" value="Empty deploy pipeline / enable_deploy_pipeline=false&lt;br&gt;Project ID binding / no deploy stages" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#759C6C;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="1700.00" y="470.00" width="680.00" height="125.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n52" value="Exactly five resource declarations: topic, project, repository, build pipeline and deploy pipeline.&lt;br&gt;An existing project can own the repository and shells. No automatic repository → build → deploy execution path is configured." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="50.00" y="625.00" width="2340.00" height="75.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n53" value="External implementation required: source connections, triggers, build specification, pipeline stages, artifacts,&lt;br&gt;deployment environments and workload targets. IAM grants, subscriptions and delivery validation are also external." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="50.00" y="720.00" width="2320.00" height="100.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n54" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No resources; all five opt-in flags false. Project/topic prerequisites are enforced by blueprint checks.&lt;br&gt;Plain lines show the exact project/topic associations only. Empty pipeline shells have no executable stages, no trigger and no build-to-deploy handoff.&lt;br&gt;The blueprint declares no external GitHub/AWS/Azure/GCP resources, artifact repository, network, application deployment or execution.&lt;br&gt;This is a source/diagram review." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1150.00" width="2460.00" height="135.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n45" value="notification_config.topic_id" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n14" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n49" value="project_id" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.2;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n46" target="n14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="455.0" y="540" /><mxPoint x="888.0" y="540" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n50" value="project_id" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n47" target="n14"><mxGeometry r